& [IR4BoundedImplementationActivationBoundaryV1] is the IR4-IA01 activation boundary for future bounded runtime graph implementation work
  + [activation_boundary_id] is ir4-bounded-implementation-activation-boundary-v1
  + [activation_boundary_uuid] is 790810e7-76c9-43b1-a096-f90fea4c275f
  + [slice_id] is IR4-IA01
  + [boundary_status] is accepted_by_completion_review_pending
  + [model_route_used] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [implementation_scope] is activation boundary and dependency decision only

  = must: confirm future file inventory, fixture inventory, expected-ledger inventory, generated-output boundary, dependency boundary, command plan, and proof gate for implementation slices
  = must: preserve accepted IR4 authority, graph, checkpoint, interrupt, and trace semantics without implementation code creation in this slice
  = must: keep package dependency changes gated until IR4-IA08 or a later dependency-authorizing slice
  - never: create runtime graph code, fixture source files, expected ledgers, generated checkpoints, generated traces, tests, dependencies, operations control, or live machine control in this slice

