  + [langgraph_dependency_state] is gated_until_IR4-IA08_dependency_decision

  = must: require IR4-IA08 or a later dependency-authorizing slice before adding package dependencies, lockfiles, imports from external LangGraph packages, or runtime requirements
  = must: keep first-pass graph runner clearly marked as proof-runtime implementation, not final external LangGraph package integration

& [ConfirmedCommandPlan: IR4RuntimeGraph] is the command and verification plan for future implementation slices
  + [baseline_test_command] is python -m unittest discover -s tests
  + [baseline_compile_command] is python -m compileall -q src tests
  + [targeted_contract_test] is python -m unittest tests.test_ir4_runtime_graph_contracts
  + [diff_hygiene_command] is git diff --check
  + [generated_output_review] is prove generated checkpoints, traces, and reports are ignored, disposable, and reproducible

  = must: run baseline tests and diff hygiene after every future slice
  = should: run compile check after code slices begin
  = must: run targeted contract tests once tests.test_ir4_runtime_graph_contracts exists

